      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm an operations manager at Lumière. I need to draft a quick email to a customer named Mrs. Gable. Her order of the Midnight Recovery Serum was delayed because of a sorting error at our Memphis facility. She's pretty annoyed and is asking for a refund on her shipping costs. Can you write a professional email that apologizes for the delay, explains it was a logistics error, and confirms we are refunding her shipping? Keep it classy.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
